<![CDATA[<div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW213822209 BCX0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">Hello {!Contact.FirstName} ,&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">&nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">I received guidance back from our Data Privacy team regarding granting your International Employees access to the Insperity Premier Time and Attendance system. We can proceed with granting your International Employees access to the Insperity Premier Time and Attendance system at this time. I will need you to provide the attached Notice to your Employees so they will be aware of their data being utilized within the system. &nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">&nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">Please let me know if you have any questions or concerns. &nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">&nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">Thank you,&nbsp;</font></p></div>]]></td>
